 "details": {
  "b45f7385-6cf5-800d-b604-1dc7bab19891": [
   "“You followed the tracks,” the stranger says. “I am Vesper. And this is Wren.” The boy looks up at his name.",
   "Wren nods. “I know. Vesper was showing me the fox paths.” You have found him alive, here in the hollow.",
   {
    "text": "Journal updated",
    "event": true
   },
   "Vesper lays out letter tiles. “I carry a flame behind glass. Held in a hand, I guide a traveller through darkness. What am I?”"
  ]
